SUMMARY:Green Swamp in the Fall (Supply)
DESCRIPTION:Join NCWF and Cape Fear Sierra Club for a walk through one of the most diverse wetlands on the east coast. The Green Swamp is a longleaf pine savanna that is managed by fire which creates openness and plant diversity. Some of the plants we hope to see include: varieties of lady tresses\, blazing star\, deer’s tongue\, slender rattlesnake root\, and fall grasses. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/green-swamp-in-the-fall-supply/
CATEGORIES:Featured
END:VEVENT
