SUMMARY:Kids In Nature Day (Matthews)
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Kids in Nature Day on October 3rd at Squirrel Lake Park from 10:00 AM-1:00 PM. You won’t want to miss this day of FREE FAMILY FUN in the park presented by HAWK (Habitat and Wildlife Keepers)\, the Town of Matthews\, and NCWF’s Great Outdoors University! Invite your family and friends to join us for a beautiful fall day of fishing\, hands-on STEM Activities\, a scavenger hunt\, nature walks\, animal explorations\, nature crafts\, and much more! \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/kids-in-nature-day-matthews/
CATEGORIES:Featured
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncwf.org/wp-content/uploads/1784226509896.jpg
END:VEVENT
