SUMMARY:Hunt Ready: Your First Deer Season Starts Here (Online)
DESCRIPTION:This Deer Hunting 101 webinar will offer adults with limited hunting experience a clear\, structured introduction to modern deer hunting. This webinar covers the essentials—deer behavior\, gear selection\, scouting\, stand placement\, and ethical decision‑making—along with practical tips that help beginners shorten their learning curve. Participants leave with a solid foundation and a realistic plan for preparing for this fall’s deer season with confidence. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/first-deer-season/
CATEGORIES:Featured
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncwf.org/wp-content/uploads/huntready.jpg
END:VEVENT
