SUMMARY:Wrong Plant\, Wrong Place: Identify\, Remove\, Replace (Waxhaw)
DESCRIPTION:Come learn how to identify common invasive plants\, remove them effectively and choose beneficial replacements for your landscape! While invasive plants can be a challenging topic\, every plant you remove helps slow their spread and creates space for native and wildlife friendly plants to thrive. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/wrong-plant-wrong-place-identify-remove-replace-waxhaw/
