SUMMARY:Spiders and Their Amazing Silk (Monroe)
DESCRIPTION:Join us and explore the fascinating world of spider biology and discover the incredible secrets behind arthropod silk! This presentation by Dr. Sarah Stellwagen will dive into spider biology and how scientists are using biomechanics and genetics to understand its evolution through her silk research at Charlotte. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/spiders-and-their-amazing-silk-monroe/
CATEGORIES:Featured
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncwf.org/wp-content/uploads/1787173769361.jpg
