SUMMARY:Practical Deer Processing (Online)
DESCRIPTION:This Deer Processing webinar will give hunters with limited experience a simple\, clear walkthrough of the complete processing workflow—from field dressing to basic butchering\, packaging\, and favorite recipes. This webinar explains how to maintain meat quality\, what tools you need\, and how to break down a deer into usable cuts\, with practical tips that help beginners avoid common mistakes and build confidence quickly. Participants leave with a solid understanding of the process and the readiness to handle their first deer this fall. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/practical-deer-processing-online/
CATEGORIES:Featured
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncwf.org/wp-content/uploads/processing.jpg
END:VEVENT
