DESCRIPTION:Join HAWK for a hands-on morning of conservation as we continue our successful effort to remove invasive plants at Squirrel Lake Park! Together we’ll tackle Wisteria and English Ivy\, helping native plants and wildlife thrive. \nREGISTER HERE
