SUMMARY:Longleaf\, Fire\, & Wildlife for Private Landowners (Jacksonville)
DESCRIPTION:Join the Down East Prescribed Burn Association\, NC Wildlife Federation and the Onslow Bight Conservation Collaboration to learn about forest and wildlife conservation programs for private landowners. Conservation opportunities for landowners can be in the form of technical assistance and funding opportunities. We are bringing in multiple organizations in North Carolina to discuss what they can offer to private landowners interested in conservation on their properties. Dinner will be provided and will include BBQ\, Fried Chicken\, & sides from Thigg’s BBQ. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/longleaf-fire-and-wildlife/
CATEGORIES:Featured
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncwf.org/wp-content/uploads/IMG_20260715_115253-D-Maddocks.jpg
END:VEVENT
